'''Spring''' is a {{Common}} [[Natural]]-type [[Blox Fruits|Blox Fruit]] that costs {{Money|60,000}} or {{Robux|180}} from the [[Blox Fruit Dealer]].

Spring allows the user to turn their body parts into springs, giving the user the ability to deal quick, long ranged attacks; and the ability to spring themselves quickly.

